  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8102.03 Certificate of occupancy",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8102.03 “Certificate of occupancy” means a document issued by a local municipality or the state, upon the satisfactory completion of required inspections, granting permission to occupy the building for its intended use.\n\nSource. #12022, eff 10-26-16",
